OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested and man sought over  
OL,4,A'altercation' by roadside              
OL,6,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said the
OL,7,Fvehicle and two men had been traced and
OL,8,Farrested. Officers remain "concerned"  
OL,9,Ffor the third man, who has not been    
OL,10,Ffound.                                 
